Third-party libraries used at run time
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LWJGL 3 (https://www.lwjgl.org/), BSD 3-Clause license, Copyright (c) 2012-present Lightweight Java Game Library
Project. Used modules: lwjgl, lwjgl-glfw, lwjgl-opengl and their native libraries. The native libraries bundle GLFW
